      "role": "cite",
      "name": "habeas:coverage",
      "commentary": "Source-tool tests publish OutlineData addresses and retain mapped NodeIds\n directly in dependencies. This required Domain method is unused in\n those flows; stable-path and filesystem-storage tests use other domains."
